{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it and check properties, else approach and move to it. Finally perform specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = ObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = ObjectVisible    />",
